{"name":"The Twentyseven Sign","slug":"glyph-twentyseven-sign","blurb":"On the trit street, Hart carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Twentyseven. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Twentyseven Sign.","seal":"3b792a765232fb75f0edef3026ee417494ab7a5d6c3e6f7e1b89f16c0c49d81a"}
